description=Training that answers to how you live. Strength and Fitness pay more when you are in shape, rested, fed and supplemented, and never pay less than they do without this installed. Push past what you can recover from and the next session costs you. Find protein, creatine, a mass gainer, electrolytes, a pre-workout and three preparations, or mix nine drinks yourself - four of them from ordinary food, once you can cook well enough. A Training tab shows every number behind the multiplier, and forty-seven settings across five sandbox pages set the pace.
